为明亮彩色写实视频风格，竖屏9:16。\n [Shot 1] 酒吧内：昏暗氛围光、彩色霓虹光晕，墙上一块霓虹灯牌写着英文 \"Cless\"；<Subject 1> 从左侧走入侧身站定，先穿薄荷绿运动背心与同款热裤，脚穿白色球鞋；<Subject 1> 中的人物（棕色高马尾、白皙皮肤、丰满身材）以 <Picture 1> 为准。画面起始带轻微失焦模糊，焦点逐渐收拢，至00:01.000 画面完全清晰。约00:02.000 她抬起一脚，约00:03.000 快速跺回原点，脚落地瞬间服装即时切换：变为紧身粉红色螺纹长袖迷你裙+半透明黑色连裤袜，鞋变为黑色高跟鞋。换装后她保持站姿，镜头按 <Video 1> 走，单镜头一镜到底，\n\noverall_soundscape:\n 安静酒吧房间底噪，伴随跺脚落地的清脆声响与换装瞬间的轻微衣物拂动声。\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\n N/A"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 211, "type": "Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 14}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [317], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "frame_count", "label": "frame_count", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "frame_count"}, {"name": "audio", "links": [318], "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"name": "video_info", "label": "video_info", "type": "VHS_VIDEOINFO", "localized_name": "video_info"}], "size": [343.3804626464844, 922.8986206054688], "pos": [-361.1070556640625, 5632.06689453125], "widgets_values": {"custom_height": 0, "force_rate": 24, "custom_width": 0, "select_every_nth": 1, "frame_load_cap": 0, "videopreview": {"paused": false, "hidden": false, "params": {"custom_height": 0, "force_rate": 24, "filename": "22fb632ddb579a77b216d5035d9b1956f71b45635cdb33e02fb2cd4056c02e2c.mp4", "custom_width": 0, "select_every_nth": 1, "frame_load_cap": 0, "format": "video/mp4", "skip_first_frames": 0, "type": "input"}}, "format": "AnimateDiff", "video": "22fb632ddb579a77b216d5035d9b1956f71b45635cdb33e02fb2cd4056c02e2c.mp4", "skip_first_frames": 0, "force_size": "Disabled", "choose video to upload": "image"}, "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "meta_batch", "label": "meta_batch", "type": "VHS_BatchManager", "localized_name": "meta_batch"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "vae", "label": "vae", "type": "VAE"